7	m	m → 1-1=0	{'a':0,'n':0,'g':0,'r':0,'m':0}
Step 4: Verify all counts are zero

At the end:

{'a':0,'n':0,'g':0,'r':0,'m':0}


✅ All counts are 0 → t used exactly the same letters as s.

👉 Therefore, "nagaram" is an anagram of "anagram".

